Mastery scoring

Implement a transparent mastery estimate between 0 and 100.

Do not calculate mastery from a single performance measure.

Combine relevant signals such as:

Accuracy over multiple attempts.
Performance across different exercises.
Independent performance without hints.
Consistency.
Retention after a delay.
Transfer to unfamiliar words and sentences.

Use sufficient sample sizes.

